
### restore_p7_permissions configuration ###

###[ SYNTAX ]###
##
## [0]<nnn> == octal file permission mode
##
## R == 'rest recursive'
## C == create if missing
## F == files only
## L == links only
## D == directories only
##
##      u:<user> g:<group>
##
##                    -->  <absolute|relative_path> [  -->  <:link-target:> ]


